    <string name="browser_start_title">Browse the web</string>
    <string name="browser_start_message">Type a web address above. JavaScript is off until you turn it on for a site from the menu.</string>
    <string name="browser_start_downloads">Direct file links (a PDF, ZIP, MP3 …) are sent to the download manager after you confirm. Streaming video, DRM-protected media and files behind a login usually cannot be downloaded.</string>
    <string name="browser_start_privacy">Websites you open here may use cookies and collect their own data about your visit.</string>
    <string name="browser_read_privacy">Read the privacy notice</string>
    <string name="browser_retry">Try again</string>
    <string name="browser_privacy_title">Privacy notice</string>
    <string name="browser_privacy_p1">Websites you open in this browser are loaded by Android\'s WebView. Each website can set cookies and use its own tools to collect data about your visit, such as your IP address, the pages you view and your device type. ALMUS YOUTUBE DOWNLOADER does not control, see or receive what a website collects.</string>
    <string name="browser_privacy_p2">What this app does to protect you: JavaScript is off by default and can be turned on for one site at a time. Third-party cookies are refused. A certificate error always stops the page, and there is no way to continue past it. Web pages get no access to this app, to your files, location, camera or microphone.</string>
    <string name="browser_privacy_p3">The app never reads, copies or sends your cookies or passwords. It keeps no browsing history of its own. It stores only the list of sites where you turned JavaScript on and the fact that you read this notice. The web engine itself keeps cookies and cache on the device until you choose Clear browsing data.</string>
    <string name="browser_privacy_p4">Downloads: a file is fetched by Android\'s download manager from its link, only after you confirm. Your login cookies are not passed on, so files that need you to be signed in, and many videos, cannot be downloaded.</string>
    <string name="browser_privacy_accept">I understand</string>
    <string name="browser_privacy_close">Close</string>
    <string name="browser_clear_title">Clear browsing data?</string>
    <string name="browser_clear_message">This removes cookies, site storage, cache and the page history of this browser, resets the JavaScript permissions and signs you out of websites. Downloaded files are not touched.</string>
    <string name="browser_clear_confirm">Clear</string>

